ts{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-13T19:22:10Z","updated_at":"2018-04-13T19:22:10Z","body":"Okay, so I'm not going crazy. I thought that it used to work.\r\n\r\nI grabbed rclone v1.39 and I can confirm that the move command works as expected.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/381237267/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"patrykcoding","id":16674420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Njc0NDIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16674420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding","html_url":"https://github.com/patrykcoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykcoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/381330779","html_url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/issues/2245#issuecomment-381330779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/2245","id":381330779,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM4MTMzMDc3OQ==","user":{"login":"ncw","id":536803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjgwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/536803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw","html_url":"https://github.com/ncw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-14T13:53:23Z","updated_at":"2018-04-14T13:53:23Z","body":"Testing with git bisect...\r\n\r\nSave this script as `test-drive.sh`\r\n\r\n```\r\n#!/bin/sh\r\n\r\nset -e\r\n\r\ngo install\r\nrclone purge drive:test/move --retries 1 || true\r\nrclone mkdir drive:test/move/Folder\r\nrclone mkdir drive:test/move/srcDir\r\nrclone -vv move drive:test/move/srcDir drive:test/move/Folder/srcDir\r\nif rclone ls drive:test/move/srcDir ; then\r\n    echo \"Dir found - bad\"\r\n    exit 1\r\nelse\r\n    echo \"Dir not found good\"\r\nfi\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit checkout master\r\ngit bisect start\r\ngit bisect bad\r\ngit checkout v1.39\r\ngit bisect good\r\ngit bisect run ./test-drive.sh\r\n```\r\n\r\nFinds in a little while 07f20dd1fd6f89b9ebdefdc8964a8e9ee9aa9892 is the first bad commit\r\n\r\n```\r\ncommit 07f20dd1fd6f89b9ebdefdc8964a8e9ee9aa9892\r\nAuthor: Fabian Möller <fabianm88@gmail.com>\r\nDate:   Wed Jan 24 00:46:41 2018 +0100\r\n\r\n    drive: migrate to api v3\r\n\r\n:040000 040000 aad5e99c16dab297c5f79c505bb4d303d2497953 35a6b83de5afb909d3f83c9dfc29b9c2d7c20247 M\tbackend\r\nbisect run success\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich is perhaps not surprising...\r\n\r\nLooking at the transaction dump, it appears to be using the wrong ID as the src parent - it is using the ID of the directory, not the ID of its parent.\r\n\r\nWill have a go at fixing now...\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/381330779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ncw","id":536803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjgwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/536803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw","html_url":"https://github.com/ncw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1574560881,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDE1NzQ1NjA4ODE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/events/1574560881","actor":{"login":"ncw","id":536803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjgwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.c